<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- BWILE BIBLE TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata yakibili iyalembele Paulo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata yakibili iyalembele Paulo kubena</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="is">UBULONDOLOSI</para>
  <para style="ip">Inkalata yakibili iyaku Tesalonika yalembelwe na Paulo umutumwa (1.1). Alembele iyi kalata mukwangufyanya panuma alemba kalata yakubalilapo ku Tesalonika, mumyaka amakuni yasano naumo panuma yakufyalwa kwakwa Klistu. Paulo ali akili mu Korinto lintu alembele iyi kalata ku lukuta mu Tessalonika, ulukuta luntu asangile lintu ali pabulendo bwabubili ubwakusabankanya Imbila (imilimo yabatumwa 17.1-10). Ibuuku lyamilimo yabatumwa lyalanda ukuti ulukuta lwapangilwe naba Yuda bamo bamo elo naba Giriki abaengi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulukuta lyamutesalonika lwaliposesyeko amano pamulandu wansita yampela elo nokwisa kwakibili ukwakwa Klistu, pantu Paulo alilembele ifingi pali iyi ilandu muli syonse inkalata sibili isyaku Tesalonika, mupepi napakati kakalata yakibili iyaku Tesalonika yaba pansita yampela. Kabili Paulo akonkomesye pakukana ikalafye ukwabula ukubomba. Umuntu onse afwile ukubombela ifyakulya fyakwe 3.6-10.</para>
  <para style="iot">Imilandu yatantama ngefi</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo pakulemba iyi kalata atampilepo ukuilondolola umwine elo nabantu bakwe. 1.1-2.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Elo atotela Lesa palukuta mu Tesalonika nokubapepela 1.1-12.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mukipande kyabubili, Paulo alanda pansita yampela.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Elo alanda pakukana ikala ukwabula ukubomba 3.1-15.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paulo alekelesye mukuposya ulukuta nakabili 3.16-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Ninebo Paulo, Sailasi elo na Timote twamilembela mwelukuta lwamu Tesalonika mwebaba muli Lesa shifwe kabili Nemfumu Yesu Klistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Ukusenaminwa elo nomutende fibe namwebo ukufuma kuli Tata elo Nemfumu Yesu Klistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubupingusi bwapakwisa kwakwa Klistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Mwebabwananyina, fwebo tulatotela Lesa lyonsefye pali mwebo, pantu ekilungeme kuli fwebo ukulakita, umusango wakitetekelo kyenu kilekula apakalamba kabili nekitemwiko mwakwatila kila umo naumo kileya kilekulilako. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Eikyo fwebo tulaitakisya mukulanda kwesu pali mwebo, munkuta syakwa Lesa. Tutasya pafyo mwakonkanyapo ukusumina elo nokushipikisya lintu mwapita mumakyusi nangula ukupakaswa. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Iki kyonse kilangililo kyakweba ati ubupingusi bwakwa Lesa bwamulinganya, pakweba ati mwaba abalinga kubufumu bwakwe buntu mukyulila. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Ikyakine Lesa wamulinganya, akakyusya abobonse abamikyusya, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />akapwisya amakyusi yenu elyo namakyusi yesu yene. Akakita ifi, ilyo Imfumu Yesu ikamonekela ukufuma mumulu nabamalaika bakwe ababulamba. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Akesa nolubingu lwamulilo ulwakwisa kanda abo bonse abasyaisiba Lesa kabili nabo bonse abashumfwila Imbila Nsuma ya Mfumu yesu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Bakakyula umuyayaya, kabili akabafumya namuceni kyakwe elyo namubukata bwabulamba bwakwe, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Lintu akaba nabwela pali bulya busiku, abamusilo bakalamulumbanya, elo abamutetekela nabo bakamukindika, kabili namwebo mukaba nabena pantu mwalisumina amasiwi yabukambone bwesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Eikyo lyonsefye tulamipepela, ukuti mube nemibeele yalinga kubwite buntu Lesa amitako. Pakuti kumaka yakwe engafikilisya ifisuma fyonse fintu mufwaya ukukita nokupwilikisya imilimo yenu yonse intu mubomba mukisumino, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />pakweba ati isina lya Mfumu Yesu likatamikwe muli mwebo, namwebo mukatamikwe muli ena, ukulingana nokusenaminwa kwakwa Lesa wesu elyo ne Mfumu yesu Yesu Klistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Umubifi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Nomba, ukulolenkana nokwisa kwa Mfumu yesu Yesu Klistu kabili nokukumana kwesu kyapamo nankwe, tulemipapata mwe babwananyina ukuti, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />tamufwile ukutunsya imitima nangu ukusakamana pamabusesemo yamo, inkalata nelyo utusebo tumo, utulanda ati nifwebo twalandile ati ubusiku bwa mfumu nabwisa kale. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Mwileka uuli onse amilufye munsila iili yonse, pantu bulya busiku tabwakese mpakafye abantu ngabayalukila Lesa kabili nomuntu mubifi akasokoloke, <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />uupinkana kabili uunsansabika ukukila pali fyonse ifitwa tulesa nafyonse fintu abantu bapepa, pakuti akapiite apakwikala mwitempele lyakwa Lesa, nokulalamda ukuti ninebo Lesa. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Busye tamwibusya ukuti ilyo nali namwebo nalimyebele ifi? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Kabili nomba mwalisiba ikyalenga ukuti kwaliba ikyamwikatilila pakuti akaisikolole pansita iyalinga. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Pantu amaka yankama yakwa mpulamafunde, kabili ikili ilabomba kabili fintu nandile ukuti fikakitika, tekuti fikitike kanofye Lesa afumyapo uulenga ifi fintu ukukitika. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Kabili elo mpulamafunde akasokoloka, uo Imfumu Yesu ikakifya kumupu wakukanwa kakwe nokumonaula kubukata bwakwisa kwakwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Ukwisa kwakwa mpulamafunde kukabafye nge mibombele yakwa Satana, akabomfya imisango yonse iyakulangilamo amaka yakwe ukupitila mufisibilo ne fipapwa ifi fikaba fyabufi. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Kabili akabomfya nensila syonse isyo umubifi abepelamo abo abaleloba. Bakaloba pantu balikene ukutemwa ikisinka kabili nokupusuka. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Pamulandu waifi Lesa alatuma amaka yakubafulunganya, mukubalenga basumine ifyabufi, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />pakuti bonse bakasekwe, pantu balikene ukusumina ikisinka lelo balebekelwa mububifi.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwalisalwa ukuti mukapusuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Lelo lyonse tulatotela Lesa pamulandu wenu mwebatemwikwa ku Mfumu, pantu pakutampa Lesa amisalile ukuti mukabe abantansi ukupusuka, ukupitila mukusangululwa kwa Mupasi elo nokusumina mukisinka. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Lesa amitile pamulandu wa Mbila Nsuma twamisimikile, pakuti mukwateko ubukata bwa mu Mfumu Yesu Klistu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Eikyo kansi mweba bwananyina beni abashipa nokwikatililila kuntambi twamishilile isyo twamifundile, ukupitila mumasiwi yantu twamyebelefye pakanwa, nayantu twamilembele munkalata. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Imfumu yesu Yesu Klistu umwine, na Lesa Tata uwatutemenwe, nokutupela ikikoselesi kyamuyayaya, nokusumina ukusuma ukupitila mukusenaminwa, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />akoselesye imitima yenu nokumikosya pakweba ati mulebomba imilimo iisuma yonse nokulalanda ifisuma.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Muletupepelako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Mukulekelesya, mwebamunyinane muletupepela ukuti amasiwi yakwa Lesa yatwalilile ukusabankana elo nokupokelelwa nomukinsi, ngefyo kyali pali mwebo. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Kabili mulepepa nokutila twingapokololwa, kubalwani, elyo nabantu ababifi pantu tebonse abakwata ikitetekelo. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Lelo Lesa wakisinka, akamikosya kabili nokumikingilila kububifi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Kabili twalisintilila mu Mfumu, ukuti mulakita, kabili mwakulakita fintu twamwebele. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Imfumu naitungulule imitima syenu mukutemwa ukwakwa Lesa namukusupikisya kwakwa Klistu. <verse eid="2TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Nomba tulemikonkomesya mweba bwananyina, mwisina lya Mfumu Yesu Klistu, ukuti talukeni kuli munyina uuli onse uuwikala mubunaŋani, kabili uushikala ukulingana namafundisyo mwapokelele ukufuma kuli fwebo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Pantu imwe mwebene mwalisiba fintu mufwile ukulatupasyanya, pantu tatwali banaŋani lintu twali namwebo, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />tatwalilepo umukate wamuntu uuli onse ukwabula ukulipa, lelo twalebombesya kabili twalebomba ubusiku nakasuba pakuti twiba ikisendo ku uli onse pali mwebo. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Tepamulandu wakweba ati tatwakwata isyo nsambu, isyakuti muletutungilila, lelo nipamulandu wakumipela ikilangililo ikisuma ikyakulatupasyanya. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Pantu nelyo twali namwebo, twalimipele iki ikipope ukuti, “Uwakana ukubomba nokulya elalya”. <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Pantu tulomfwa ukuti bamo pali mwebo banaŋani, tababomba inkito baikalilafye ulwambo. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Nomba abantu bapalefyo tulabakonkomesya kumaka ya Mfumu Yesu Klistu ukuti balekita fintu bafwile ukulakita pakuti balepanga ubwikasi bwabo. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Mweba bwananyina, mwilatendwa ukulakita ifisuma. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ngyakyakuti uuli onse akana ukukonka fintu twalanda muli iyi inkalata, mumwisibe bwino uyo muntu kabili mwilasangwa nao, pakuti abe nensoni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Mwilamumona ngo mulwani wenu, lelo mulemusoka ngamunonko.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasiwi yakulekelesya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Nomba lekeni Imfumu yamutende iyine, imipe umutende munsita syonse kabili namusila yonse. Imfumu ibe namwebo bonse. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Nebo ne Paulo nalemba aya amaposyo namaboko yandi. Ngekisibilo ku nkalata sintu nemba. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Ukusenaminwa kwa Mfumu yesu Yesu Klistu kube namwebo bonse.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>